From: NixOS RK3588 maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: keep NanoPi R6 HDMI PHY enabled

The unified HDMI/eDP PHY is enabled earlier in the common R6 DTS.
Do not disable it again when supplying the training table. This fixes
the HDMI provider for both R6C and R6S while preserving the table.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-nanopi-r6-common.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-nanopi-r6-common.dtsi
@@ -236,7 +236,6 @@
 		/* voltage swing 3, pre-emphasis 0 */
 		0x0d 0x00 0x00 0x00 0x00 0x00
 	>;
-	status = "disabled";
 };
 
 &i2c0 {
